# ITOps Hub — developer environment overrides
#
# This file contains NO secrets and NO credentials. ITOps Hub is a local
# desktop application: all configuration lives in the local SQLite settings
# store, and no secrets are required or accepted anywhere in the app.
#
# Copy to `.env` for local development overrides if needed.

# Redirect the data directory (SQLite database, log files) to a custom
# location. Useful for development and testing.
# Windows example: C:\itops-dev-data
# Linux example:   /tmp/itops-dev-data
ITOPS_HUB_DATA_DIR=
